     "resume": "This CSIRT has recently recorded, in the national context, a significant increase in active use of CVE-2026-48907 – already healed by the vendor and treated within the AL02/260615/CSIRT-ITA – to the damage of web servers exposed. This vulnerability affects the Joomla Content Editor plugin (JCE), extension for the known Content Management System (CMS) Joomla!."
