     "resume": "From 21 June to 6 July 2026 the Greek government held an OpenGov consultation on the national AI Act framework. The draft designates the Hellenic Data Protection Authority (HDPA) as market surveillance authority and single point of contact, EETT as notifying authority, and provides for a regulatory sandbox and penalties."
